特殊单元格值：
@itemize
@item @code{nil} prints typically the same as "", but allows previous
细胞溢出。
@item '*skip* replaces @code{nil} when the previous cell actually does
溢出;没有为它打印任何内容。
@item '*error* indicates that the formula signaled an error instead of
